      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "后期敌人和子弹变多后白色准心偶尔会看不到。",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198060659624/recommended/4090270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "瞄准射击和收集资源的操作令人烦躁。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "Having to aim to shoot and collect resources felt annoying",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fromthemoonx/recommended/4090270/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
